 expiry and cleaning-crew validation

Regenerate sparse-state and complete-block recovery/runtime vectors for the C17a Coin provenance tail: version2, LE64 fee share, and LE64 saturated expiration height. Native maximum Coin sizes gain the same17bytes. Keep transaction/monetary profiles and all behavioral assertions.

The sparse scalar generator supplies exact expected hashes independently of C++. Recover the reorg generator and immutable input manifest from the earlier lane-E evidence, checking every reference module against pinned c2a222f1ed04857139c6ade9f6d57adff1f20bb8. Its control without the provenance tail reproduces all historical16 vectors; current generation validates14 positive bodies and preserves2 negative bodies. Both C++ corpora match all16 regenerated entries exactly.

Native focused sparse-state, reorg-recovery and development-runtime executables pass. Generator commands, immutable script/input/reference hashes and before/after binary receipts are retained in the sweep evidence ledger; production codecs and consensus are unchanged.

