From 931fb5c7876e38a79e424bc227b0bc06b32387f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:21:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 04/49] fixup! test(v2): migrate functional fixtures and
 harnesses to native transactions

Restore a real legacy MiniWallet default and legacy cached-chain funding for inherited functional tests. Retain the native wallet as explicit NativeMiniWallet with its actual native output programs, BIP340 signer and rescan behavior; update its dedicated native test to request it explicitly. Restore the legitimate SCRIPTSIG_OP_TRUE import.

Add a functional control that mines typed funding, broadcasts and mines real transfers for legacy OP_TRUE/P2PK and native OP_TRUE/BIP340. It passes on the preserved OFF daemon. Legacy funding uses version2 and spending version1 with scriptSig; native funding/spending use version7 with witnesses. BIP68/CLTV controls advance past the original family/decode failures and retain their independent reorg/classification assertions for separate diagnosis.

Tier: V2
